        <h1>Plan it. <em>Leave it better.</em></h1>
        <p class="lede">Tercet Law is estate planning and life law: the will, the trust, the directive — and a plan to live on. Flat fees.</p>
        <div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="#" data-open-form>Book a planning call</a><a class="btn btn-line" href="#how">How it works</a></div>
        <p class="welcome">Welcome to Tercet — <b>Live</b></p>
      </div>
      <div class="proof"><div class="wrap proof-grid"><div><b>3</b><span>Documents every adult needs</span></div><div><b>Flat</b><span>Fees, quoted up front</span></div><div><b>1</b><span>Attorney, start to finish</span></div><div><b>AL</b><span>Licensed · virtual nationwide</span></div></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="sec" id="why"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">The problem</p><h2>Everyone means to do it.<br>Most never do.</h2></div>
      <div class="pains"><div class="pain"><h3>Unwritten</h3><p>No will. No directive. A family left guessing.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unfunded</h3><p>A trust on paper that owns nothing.</p></div><div class="pain"><h3>Unlived</h3><p>A plan that was never a plan to live on.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="russ"><div class="wrap guide-grid">
      <img src="/russ-michaels.jpg" alt="Russ Michaels" width="340" height="425" loading="lazy" />
      <div><p class="eyebrow">Your attorney</p><h2>Russ Michaels</h2><p class="lede">Alabama-licensed since 2014. Twenty years leading organizations before and alongside the practice. He treats the plan as the start of a life, not the end.</p><blockquote>Sometimes we meet life where it is, not where we are. We hold that together.</blockquote><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing">Writing</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/russ-michaels/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="how"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">How it works</p><h2>Three steps.</h2></div>
      <div class="steps"><div class="step"><div class="n">01</div><h3>The call</h3><p>Thirty minutes. What you have, what you want, what it costs.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">02</div><h3>The plan</h3><p>Flat fee. Will, trust, directive, powers. Funded, not just signed.</p></div><div class="step"><div class="n">03</div><h3>The life</h3><p>Life law: the plan gets a person to live it. The keys continue at Vault Human.</p></div></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec" id="pricing"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Pricing</p><h2>Flat fees. No surprises.</h2></div>
      <div class="offers"><div class="offer feat"><div class="tag">Start here</div><h3>The Essentials</h3><div class="price">From $1,500</div><p>Will, health directive, powers of attorney. Signed and explained.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Most chosen</div><h3>The Trust Plan</h3><div class="price">Quoted</div><p>Revocable trust, funded. Everything in the Essentials.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="/pricing">See pricing</a></div><div class="offer"><div class="tag">Life law</div><h3>The Plan to Live On</h3><div class="price">Included</div><p>A Tercet client is a Vault Human client. The keys continue, one a day.</p><a class="btn btn-line" href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Learn more</a></div></div>
      
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec dark" id="family"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Learn · Love · Live</p><h2>Tercet is the future.</h2><p class="lede">Learn from the past. Love the present. Live for the future.</p></div>
      <div class="tl-rail"></div>
      <div class="tl-cards"><a class="tlc brown" href="https://www.fretworksystems.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Learn · The past</div><h3>Fretwork</h3><p>Reads the systems you inherited and rebuilds them.</p><span>fretworksystems.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc green" href="https://triplicityadvisory.com" target=_blank rel=noopener><div class="when">Love · The present</div><h3>Triplicity</h3><p>The coaching company. A coach reads your log for a year.</p><span>triplicityadvisory.com ↗</span></a><a class="tlc navy me" href="https://www.tercetlaw.com"><div class="when">Live · The future</div><h3>Tercet</h3><p>Estate and life-law planning. The documents a life is lived on.</p><span>tercetlaw.com ↗</span></a></div>
      <p class="constant">The Constant: <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com">Vault Human</a> — Listen.</p>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec alt" id="faq"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head"><p class="eyebrow">Questions</p><h2>Straight answers.</h2></div>
      <div class="faq"><details><summary>What does Tercet do?</summary><p>Estate planning — wills, trusts, directives — with flat fees, and a plan to live on.</p></details><details><summary>Do I need a trust?</summary><p>Sometimes. The call tells you honestly.</p></details><details><summary>Where are you licensed?</summary><p>Alabama. Virtual appointments nationwide for Alabama matters.</p></details><details><summary>What is life law?</summary><p>The documents as the start of a life lived on purpose, not the end.</p></details></div>
    </div></section>

    <section class="sec final" id="begin"><div class="wrap">
      <h2>Book a planning call.</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes. You leave knowing what you need and what it costs.</p>
